{"id": "DfSAns6TFP1", "title": "Video by gopalakfarms", "description": "🪔 Humne ek nayi series shuru ki hai: granthon ki woh kahaniyan jo aaj bhi hamari rasoi se judi hain. 🌿📜\n\nIs reel mein Rigved ki katha hai. Pani naam ke luteron ne gaayon ko guphaa mein band kar diya tha, aur ghee unhi gaayon ke andar chhupa tha. 🐄🏔️ Indra ne apni doot Sarama ko bheja, aur Sarama ne unka lalach thukra diya. Phir Indra ne pahaad toda, gaayein bahar aayin, aur ghee ki dhaara beh nikli. ✨🔱\n\n🐕 Sarama ko hum shwan ke roop mein dikhate hain, kyunki parampara unhe Devashuni kehti hai. Rigved ka Sarama hymn unhe sirf Indra ki doot kehta hai.\n\n🥛 Aaj bhi shudh ghee mehnat se banta hai: raat bhar dahi jamta hai, bilona chalta hai, aur makkhan dheere-dheere pakta hai. 🧈🔥\n\n📖 Series ki agli kahani jald aa rahi hai. Follow karke rakhiye. ❤️\n\n📜 Katha ka aadhar: Rigved 4.58, 10.108, 1.62 aur 3.31.\n\n#Rigveda #A2Ghee #BilonaGhee #GirCow #SanatanDharma", "channel": "gopalakfarms", "uploader_id": "70266713702", "uploader": "Gopalak Farms", "timestamp": 1793713240, "like_count": 4055, "comment_count": 58, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/145.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-3242692145931291a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 67.339, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOcPve4p5-SpAbJfoqQdtSq7UFFBuNBQPgzHiFRg8dmWmJyX1_QYHoaSWGuncTzwUiyEU7fx4SEYMcuSlAfRylWyhFBDOEgIpu4dGw.mp4?_nc_cat=103&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=jNdMxksODosQ7kNvwFtbVyE&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=kp_co1lvHOUT60xi0kOhBw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQT0XQg8VjRrPMfmHrpsM_AONEJUeosQMwfnme